      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think the correct fix would be to change the check in crash collector. It should look at subset of flags (actually not sure which one besides PANIC_DATA_FLAG_FRAME_VALID). The purpose of TRUNCATED flag is to notify that not all data was copied (for whatever reason) and the current CL is disabling this notification.",
      "revId": "cd0bd91d4a040416ca55e55e0ed118415dd3181c",
