      "writtenOn": "2023-09-05T21:41:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Oh sorry, my comment was mostly regarding the `_TRUNCATED` flag. I think using `PANIC_DATA_FLAG_OLD_HOSTCMD` is totally legit.\n\n\u003e  How about I add this as a response parameter in v1 of the command?\n-- sounds great!",
